      "text": "The APTA guideline cites its reference 174, the Combs et al. randomized trial, among studies indicating superior balance outcomes for boxing over traditional multi-modal exercise, whereas that trial's abstract reports that the traditional exercise group had significantly greater gains in balance confidence than the boxing group.",
